{"seq":4,"slug":"ci-cd-pipelines","title":"CI/CD 流水线","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pipeline-design-patterns","title":"流水线设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/pipeline-design-patterns","wordCount":1068,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"github-actions-deep-dive","title":"GitHub Actions 深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/github-actions-deep-dive","wordCount":771,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"artifact-and-registry","title":"制品与镜像仓库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/artifact-and-registry","wordCount":970,"readingTime":4},{"seq":4,"slug":"deployment-strategies","title":"部署策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/ci-cd-pipelines/deployment-strategies","wordCount":986,"readingTime":4}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ci-cd-流水线-简介\">CI/CD 流水线 简介</h1><p>CI/CD（持续集成/持续部署）是 DevOps 工程实践的核心支柱。持续集成确保每次代码提交都经过自动化的构建、测试和质量检查；持续部署则将通过验证的代码自动推送到生产环境。一条设计良好的 CI/CD 流水线能够将代码从提交到上线的周期从数周缩短到数分钟。</p>\n<p>本章将带你深入四个核心主题：</p>\n<p><strong>流水线设计模式</strong> — 理解 CI/CD 流水线的核心阶段、分支策略与触发机制，掌握构建高效可靠流水线的设计原则。</p>\n<p><strong>GitHub Actions 深入</strong> — 系统学习 GitHub Actions 的工作流语法、作业编排、缓存策略和自定义 Action 开发。</p>\n<p><strong>制品与镜像仓库</strong> — 掌握构建产物和容器镜像的版本管理、存储策略与分发机制。</p>\n<p><strong>部署策略</strong> — 深入蓝绿部署、金丝雀发布、滚动更新等生产级部署模式，以及自动回滚机制。</p>\n<p>建议从流水线设计模式入手理解全局，然后通过 GitHub Actions 实践具体的流水线实现。</p>\n"}